---
const github = 'https://github.com/XiaoleC05/CongoRAG';
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div>
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <img src="/brand/mark.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" />
        <span>Congo<span class="rag">RAG</span></span>
      </a>
      <p>本地运行的 RAG 问答与 Agent 平台。代码使用 MIT 许可证；本站只做介绍和文档，不提供在线服务。</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>文档</h4>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/docs/quickstart/">快速开始</a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/models/">接入模型</a>
        <a href="/docs/deploy/reverse-proxy/">部署</a>
        <a href="/docs/technical/architecture/">技术细节</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>项目</h4>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href={github} rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        <a href={github + '/releases'} rel="noopener">Releases</a>
        <a href={github + '/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md'} rel="noopener">CHANGELOG</a>
        <a href={github + '/blob/main/LICENSE'} rel="noopener">MIT License</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>反馈</h4>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href={github + '/issues'} rel="noopener">Issues</a>
        <a href={github + '/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md'} rel="noopener">参与贡献</a>
        <a href={github + '/security/policy'} rel="noopener">安全策略</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="legal">
    <span>© 2026 XiaoleC05 · MIT</span>
    <span>
      <a href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/" rel="noopener">鲁ICP备2026038838号-1</a>
      ·
      <a href="https://beian.mps.gov.cn/#/query/webSearch?code=37028202001309" rel="noopener">鲁公网安备37028202001309号</a>
    </span>
  </div>
</footer>
